msgstr "使用目錄作為引數啟動 Gwyddion 時，會開啟顯示該目錄的檔案選擇對話方塊。"

#: gwyddion/tips.c:105
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"File → Open Recent → Document History opens a browser of recently loaded "
